title: c Team Design Pattern
syntax: xwiki/2.1
%%WIKI-SYNC-META%%
**Abstract.** Team Design Patterns generalise recurring allocations between people and systems across activities and use cases. TDP-01 describes consent-gated social brokering with human handover; Kinnect is its project-specific instantiation. The morning-care pattern is listed separately.

